      "comment": "HARD MAN (5) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 24.38. Jumping from the pinch draw but goes well over this trip. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. BLACK MASCARA (8) looks close to another win after finishing second last time (24.80) at this track. Must be included in calculations. DR. FREDDY (2) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (24.85) at this track in a Restricted WIN H. Lines up from box 2 for the first time. Can measure up. DR.DARLING (3) is sure to play a big role again after nice run of wins.",
